(O106 - Probe Boss Center)
(Probes outside diameter of a boss to find center, sets work offset)
(Requires: [PROBE] VEL, SEARCH_DIST, XY_CLEARANCE, Z_DROP, DIAMETER in LinuxCNC INI)
(Usage: Position over boss, then call)

O106 sub

    #<probe_vel> = #<_ini[PROBE]VEL>
    #<search_dist> = #<_ini[PROBE]SEARCH_DIST>
    #<xy_clear> = #<_ini[PROBE]XY_CLEARANCE>
    #<z_drop> = #<_ini[PROBE]Z_DROP>
    #<probe_diam> = #<_ini[PROBE]DIAMETER>

    M5
    M9
    G90
    G40
    G49

    (Record starting position above boss)
    #<start_x> = #5420
    #<start_y> = #5421
    #<start_z> = #5422

    (=== 1. Probe X+ Side ===)
    (Move right to clear boss)
    G90 G0 X[#<start_x> + #<xy_clear>]
    (Drop to probe height)
    G91 G38.3 Z-#<z_drop> F#<probe_vel>
    (Probe left towards boss)
    G38.2 X-#<search_dist> F#<probe_vel>
    #<x1> = #5061
    (Back off to right)
    G0 X[#<search_dist> / 4.0]
    (Raise to starting Z height to clear boss)
    G90 G0 Z#<start_z>

    (=== 2. Probe X- Side ===)
    (Move across to left side of boss with Z safely raised)
    G90 G0 X[#<start_x> - #<xy_clear>]
    (Drop to probe height)
    G91 G38.3 Z-#<z_drop> F#<probe_vel>
    (Probe right towards boss)
    G38.2 X#<search_dist> F#<probe_vel>
    #<x2> = #5061
    (Back off to left)
    G0 X-[#<search_dist> / 4.0]
    (Raise to starting Z height to clear boss)
    G90 G0 Z#<start_z>

    (Calculate X Center)
    #<center_x> = [[#<x1> + #<x2>] / 2.0]
    G90 G0 X#<center_x>
    G10 L20 P0 X0

    (=== 3. Probe Y+ Side ===)
    (Move to Y+ clearance along true X center with Z safely raised)
    G90 G0 X#<center_x> Y[#<start_y> + #<xy_clear>]
    (Drop to probe height)
    G91 G38.3 Z-#<z_drop> F#<probe_vel>
    (Probe down/-Y towards boss)
    G38.2 Y-#<search_dist> F#<probe_vel>
    #<y1> = #5062
    (Back off in +Y)
    G0 Y[#<search_dist> / 4.0]
    (Raise to starting Z height to clear boss)
    G90 G0 Z#<start_z>

    (=== 4. Probe Y- Side ===)
    (Move across to Y- clearance with Z safely raised)
    G90 G0 X#<center_x> Y[#<start_y> - #<xy_clear>]
    (Drop to probe height)
    G91 G38.3 Z-#<z_drop> F#<probe_vel>
    (Probe up/+Y towards boss)
    G38.2 Y#<search_dist> F#<probe_vel>
    #<y2> = #5062
    (Back off in -Y)
    G0 Y-[#<search_dist> / 4.0]
    (Raise to starting Z height to clear boss)
    G90 G0 Z#<start_z>

    (Calculate Y Center)
    #<center_y> = [[#<y1> + #<y2>] / 2.0]
    G90 G0 Y#<center_y>
    G10 L20 P0 Y0

    (Move to final center at safe starting Z height)
    G90 G0 X0 Y0 Z#<start_z>
    (MSG, Boss center found and set to X0 Y0)

O106 endsub
M2
